# Product & Cost Guardrails

Canonical docs (read when changing product/backend direction):

- `docs/PRODUCT.md` — product vision
- `docs/TECH.md` — stack, cost, folder conventions
- `docs/USER_JOURNEY.md` — backend journey steps

## Cost

Stay **$0** until real users or Spark Pass revenue: no Redis/Stripe/Sentry/paid moderation in Phase 1. Redis free tier only when Phase 2 matching starts.

## Stack baseline

**Server:** Node 20+, Express 5, Mongoose 9, Socket.IO 4.8+, Zod 4, TypeScript 7.

**Client:** React 19, Vite 8, React Router 7, Tailwind 4, TanStack Query 5, Zustand 5, Zod 4, TypeScript 7. Phase 2 must follow the same majors — no parallel older stack.

## Auth note

Connected layer currently uses a single access JWT cookie. Prefer access+refresh when hardening auth. Do not add unused `REFRESH_TOKEN_*` env keys. Admin uses a separate httpOnly `adminToken` cookie (never put `ADMIN_SECRET` in `VITE_*`).
